Tier 6 -- pseudo-cluster staged integration, shape A (reaper guest).

Three vnet jails as nodes on an internal bridge, real ZFS lineage, real ssh,
real CARP, and a fence driver whose "power off" stops the target jail. Named
stages, individually runnable: repl, interrupt, promote, quorum, concurrency,
failback, resurrection, hostile. See TESTING.md §7.

Empty at M0.

Files named t_*.sh are tests; anything else here is ignored.
